Description: local eBPF fileless malware detector for GNOME and KDE
 A privileged daemon observes high-confidence fileless execution and injection
 behavior. Optional response mode can block memfd execution on supported hosts.
 An unprivileged desktop indicator displays locally retained alerts. The
 service does not send telemetry.
